<title>USA: NeoTherapeutics tests Alzheimer's compound.</title>
<headline>NeoTherapeutics tests Alzheimer's compound.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>NeoTherapeutics Inc said it has begun Phase I/II clinical trials to evaluate the safety and efficacy of its AIT-082 compound in patients with Alzheimer's disease.</p>
<p>The company said pre-clinical laboratory studies showed the compound stimulates the production of neurotrophins, or natural proteins which enhance the regrowth of damaged neural tissue.</p>
</text>
